      "message": "test(ui): pin Escape closing the topmost dialog without applying\n\nEscape already closes the unsaved-changes prompt and the fixture library\ndialogs: both are egui Modals, and egui consumes Escape for the topmost\none, which enqueues the same Cancel as the button. Nothing was applied.\nNo behaviour changed; these tests pin it with real key events.\n\nFixes #1256\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
